03:20:58,670 --> 03:21:04,570
 You wouldn't believe, by the way, how much effort it was to create this in Blender previously.

3647
03:21:04,570 --> 03:21:07,570
 Like, a bit of brief history on scattering in Blender.

3648
03:21:07,770 --> 03:21:16,450
 The old, old way was to use the particle system in Blender, which was like old and legacy and it was badly coded.

