03:21:16,450 --> 03:21:19,430
 It kind of worked, but it was, you know, it was annoying.

3650
03:21:19,430 --> 03:21:23,930
 And then they came out with geometry nodes, which was all math-based and mathematical.

3651
03:21:23,930 --> 03:21:28,290
 But to do stuff like this required so much work to set it up.

3652
03:21:28,550 --> 03:21:33,550
 And then now they've come out with scatter on surface, which is still geometry nodes.

3653
03:21:33,550 --> 03:21:36,390
 So, if you don't know geometry nodes, there's a tab at the top there.

3654
03:21:36,390 --> 03:21:37,050
 You can click it.

