03:21:41,670 --> 03:21:47,030
 But the cool thing is, is that this just comes packaged with Blender now and this is already done.

3658
03:21:47,030 --> 03:21:52,710
 So, the guys at the Blender Institute that, you know, need your money, right, so that they can keep working.

3659
