 I wish it wasn't like this, although I understand why it is, because people that are rigging often want this turned on.

3690
03:23:52,550 --> 03:23:57,030
 But your brush, you want to check front faces only.

3691
03:23:57,030 --> 03:24:01,150
 Because if you don't do that, then you'll still get your sprinkles underneath your donut.

3692
03:24:01,710 --> 03:24:07,850
 So, now that I've got that, I'm going to, yeah, I mean, you can, like, paint over the mesh like this.

3693
03:24:07,850 --> 03:24:16,850
 A quicker way to do it would be to go into here where my head is, data, then go into edit mode, right, like this, right?

