 But I was at SIGGRAPH and I was watching a talk where they had the most amazing, the guys at WETA know how to do a

3719
03:25:47,140 --> 03:25:47,830
 presentation.

3720
03:25:48,210 --> 03:25:57,190
 But it was just, like, full of detail and, like, tiny, like, because they had, like, monkeys in the rapids and, like,

3721
03:25:57,190 --> 03:25:58,930
 just the sheeting.

3722
03:25:58,930 --> 03:26:04,950
 And the plants had to have just the right amount of wind or us, you know?

