4073
03:46:50,970 --> 03:46:56,010
 So for example, if you want the icing to be connected to the donut, then you first select

4074
03:46:56,010 --> 03:47:01,990
 the icing, you shift select the donut, then you hit control P to parent.

4075
03:47:02,690 --> 03:47:05,970
 And there's, you compare it to the object or object, keep transform.

4076
03:47:05,970 --> 03:47:07,630
 I always choose keep transform.

4077
03:47:07,630 --> 03:47:11,970
 Otherwise it can like clear the original location and you kind of lose its location.

4078
03:47:11,970 --> 03:47:13,910
 So always keep transform.

