4297
03:58:28,090 --> 03:58:33,490
 The problem with that is because of the inverse square law, every doubling of distance.

4298
03:58:33,490 --> 03:58:36,510
 So from like here to here, right?

4299
03:58:36,510 --> 03:58:40,350
 It's going to, hang on, from here to here?

