03:58:41,490 --> 03:58:47,750
 But basically, like from the mug to the end of the donut, it could lose something like a

4302
03:58:47,750 --> 03:58:48,970
 third of its energy.

4303
03:58:48,970 --> 03:58:52,650
 It's just an, what do you call it?

4304
03:58:52,650 --> 03:58:55,770
 It's not something that is obvious, but it is really, really important.

4305
03:58:55,770 --> 03:58:59,650
 So if something needs to be far away or appear to be far away, you got to try to make it look

4306
03:58:59,650 --> 03:59:01,070
