4370
04:01:53,030 --> 04:01:57,310
 Now, some of you might be wondering, how can we improve this so it doesn't look crap?

4371
04:01:57,310 --> 04:02:04,810
 Because what we are using right now, this is called the EV rendering engine.

4372
04:02:04,810 --> 04:02:09,130
 And it's the reason we've got this kind of fuzzy noise to our shadows.

4373
04:02:09,130 --> 04:02:15,090
 It's the reason we have some of our objects are not really casting much of a shadow in

4374
04:02:15,090 --> 04:02:15,730
 our scene.

4375
04:02:15,730 --> 04:02:21,690
 And it's also the reason you might notice that as you like rotate around, right?

4376
04:02:21,690 --> 04:02:25,670
 You got like, wow, look at this, like bright lighting on the plane here.

4377
04:02:25,790 --> 04:02:27,630
 And watch what happens as I move the camera.

4378
04:02:27,630 --> 04:02:29,530
 Just disappears.

4379
04:02:29,530 --> 04:02:32,790
 So EV is a game engine.

4380
04:02:32,790 --> 04:02:34,590
 So it's doing a lot of game hackery.

4381
04:02:34,590 --> 04:02:41,070
 And that means it is largely, it is due to being screen space, meaning that it's doing

4382
04:02:41,070 --> 04:02:42,410
 bounce lighting here.

4383
04:02:42,410 --> 04:02:42,850
 Okay.

4384
04:02:42,890 --> 04:02:47,090
 So it's bouncing off the plane onto this wall here.

4385
04:02:47,090 --> 04:02:53,170
 However, it's only visible, it can only see what the camera sees.

4386
04:02:53,170 --> 04:02:54,530
 So it's called screen space.

4387
04:02:54,530 --> 04:02:58,970
 And that means that the moment that this moves away and we no longer have that bright light

4388
04:02:58,970 --> 04:03:02,750
 reflecting off there, it doesn't know that that plane exists and that something should

4389
04:03:02,750 --> 04:03:03,330
 bounce up there.

4390
04:03:03,510 --> 04:03:06,410
 So it can result in these like large changes of lighting.

4391
04:03:06,410 --> 04:03:11,650
 It's kind of the biggest issue if you're making animations and the camera's flying through

4392
04:03:11,650 --> 04:03:15,090
 some spaces and you don't want to have lighting kind of changing all over the place.

4393
04:03:15,090 --> 04:03:17,810
 I've got a whole video on EV if you want to watch that.

